# Arm moves on Buttons (More controls; a player's ask, 0.1.13: wrists and hands that hurt to swing), from the file
# (QUEST_VR_OPTIONS=button_moves 1), by a bolt crate (class 511) with the Blaster held. The right grip squeezed with
# the hand still is the game's own swing (Square): the crate breaks and its bolts are counted ([sim] bolts), a second
# squeeze swings again. Fast strokes with the grip open do nothing (no [vr-wrench] hit line). A jump with the grip
# squeezed at its top: the game's jump attack (hero state 0x14). Then the trigger: with the wrench in the hand it asks
# for the Blaster back ("the trigger asks the last gun back"), and the next pull fires it (its rounds go down).
# Last, the left trigger held (the crouch, R1) and the grip squeezed: the game's own move for the two (its wrench
# thrown, hero state and shot comet). The start logs "[vr-options] Arm moves: Buttons".
